# PT-RESTIR-1: the path tracer's light choice through a world light grid (PathTracing.LightSampling 1, NVIDIA RTXDI ReGIR: per-cell light reservoirs built by "PathTracing: Light Grid" each traced frame, a few resampled at each vertex by f * cos) instead of every light's estimate at every vertex (0, UE EstimateLight). Both unbiased: the same image in the limit, less noise at the lamps with the grid.
# Headless shots (the project is outside the repo), F:/BistroFoliageProj, GI PathTraced (6), Reflections PathTraced (5), PathTracing.Denoiser 0 (the raw sum: noise measured on the estimator, not on the filter), 120 paths.
Проект F:/BistroFoliageProj/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/GI_Bistro_Night.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method PathTraced"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Off"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.SamplesPerPixel 128"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.LightSampling 0"
Когда frames 200
Тогда-вид 0_night_all_120 the all-lights baseline after 120 paths; 0 errors / 0 VUID in editor.log
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.LightSampling 1"
Когда frames 200
Тогда-вид 1_night_grid_120 mean brightness within 2 % of 0_night_all_120 (unbiased); local std (the 5 x 5 neighbourhood std of luminance, mean over the lamp-lit pavement and facades) lower than 0_night_all_120's; 0 errors / 0 VUID in engine_log
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.LightSampling 0"
Когда run Quality "Quality: PathTracing.Denoiser Auto"
Когда run Quality "Quality: Reflections.Method Level"
Когда run Quality "Quality: GlobalIllumination.Method Level"
Тогда-вид restir_reset overrides cleared (LightSampling 0, Denoiser Auto, GI/Reflections back to Level)
